0..51 Comment "//! This source shows shared views kept in regions."
52..55 Comment "//!"
56..115 Comment "//! A kept shared view can outlive the access that lent it."
116..170 Comment "//! Its held value stays frozen until the region ends."
171..234 Comment "//! A value can enter a region at any time and never leaves it."
235..238 Comment "//!"
239..282 Comment "//! The checker orders regions by outlives."
283..335 Comment "//! It releases the held value when the region ends."
336..382 Comment "//! Lifetimes that control states follow boats"
383..421 Comment "//! [boats-2024-references_are_jumps]."
422..482 Comment "//! Regions as ordered extents follow Koronkevich and Bowman"
483..535 Comment "//! [Koronkevich-2025-type_universes_kripke_worlds]."
536..539 Comment "//!"
